<title>UK: KB International adds 40 mln marks to 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>KB International adds 40 mln marks to 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank BV.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK</p>
<p> AMT    *140 MLN DEM  COUPON     **4.0     MATURITY    20.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.20    PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    100.20    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  2.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED NOVEMBER 2003 AND MARCH 2004</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MLN MARKS 08.JAN.97</p>
<p>	     **FOR FIRST THREE YEARS AND 7.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
